# Local development secrets for the incident profile services.
# Shared across incident-console-v2, vlm-gateway, mock-backend and eval.
.env.local
**/.env.local
**/.env.remote

# P1/RP1 multi-model evaluation working data of the archived v1 console: real
# (not demo) ground-truth Excel, split manifests, cached R2 video downloads,
# and result JSON/CSV. Never committed - see archived/incident-console/prompts.py
# and archived/incident-console/scripts/eval_*.py. The small split manifests
# themselves are tracked under archived/incident-console/eval_reproducibility/.
# The pre-archive path stays ignored so an old local copy is never committed.
archived/incident-console/eval_data/
incident-console/eval_data/

# The complete human-labelled ground-truth workbook (real annotations of real
# surveillance clips) kept at the profile root as the source for the ground-truth
# audit and correction work. Never committed; eval reads its own gitignored copy
# under eval/eval_data/.
/Complete Ground Truth Labelling.xlsx
